NOTE ON THIS LOG BUNDLE — Evan, 2026-08-07
==========================================

Two deliberate changes were made to this bundle before pushing. Everything else
is byte-for-byte as Kenshi wrote it.

1. KenshiCoop_join.log.20260807-192520.prev.log WAS FILTERED.

   Raw size 85.4 MB / 830,147 lines. 779,699 of those lines were a single
   repeated shape:

     [JOIN] INFO: SCENARIO PROXY hand=N,N,N,N,N pos=N.N,N.N,N.N

   Only lines containing "SCENARIO PROXY" were removed. 50,448 lines kept,
   file is now 5.2 MB. No [load], [save], XFER, GO, [net], [steam], [life],
   [pose], [med] or [gate] lines were touched.

   Reason: the unfiltered bundle was 113.6 MB, which would have gone
   permanently into the shared repo's git history and be carried by every
   future clone. Filtered bundle is 33.4 MB.

   The unfiltered original is on Evan's machine and can be sent over Discord
   if you need it — just ask.

   If SCENARIO PROXY at that volume is not intentional, that is worth a look
   on its own: it is 94% of that session's log by line count.

2. KenshiCoop_join_20260806-212515_aug2-build-baseline.log IS A RENAMED COPY.

   The original filename is KenshiCoop_join.log.prev — it is NOT collected by
   ShareLog.ps1, because the glob is 'KenshiCoop_*.log' and that name ends in
   '.prev'. It was copied to a .log name purely so the collector would pick it
   up. Contents unmodified.

   This file matters: it is the Aug 2 build (9BDEC6A2...) completing an
   XFER-COMMIT over an existing DIVERGED save at 21:24 on Aug 6 — the baseline
   that shows the Aug 6 build regressed.

   ShareLog.ps1 on origin/main has the same glob, so this file is silently
   missed on every player's machine, on every push. Suggested fix: add
   'KenshiCoop_*.prev' to the pattern list in ShareLog.ps1 line ~55.
